# 2D SCFT of a three-site rigid mesogen A-A-B blended with a C homopolymer.
# A and C are strongly incompatible, so the mesogens and polymer phase separate.
# The B end of the mesogen is only weakly repelled by C, so it preferentially
# sits on the polymer side of the interface (compare rhoSpecies1.dat to
# rhoSpecies0.dat across the interface).
box fts scft
Dim 2
grid 64 32

# Number of orientations on the unit circle. Must come before any
# species with a tensor field and before the liquid-crystal molecule.
u_grid 32

boxLengths 16.0 8.0
Nr 10
C 0.4
tolerance Heff 1.0e-9

# A carries the orientation tensor field; B is the mesogen end group; C is the polymer
species A tensor
species B
species C

# molecule keyword, liquid-crystal, vol fraction, number of sites, species of each site in order
# The sites may be of different species. With lc_style middle only the central
# site (the second A here) carries the Maier-Saupe interaction, and its species
# must be declared with 'tensor'.
molecule liquid-crystal phi 0.5 3 A A B smear gaussian 0.4 bond_length 1.0 lc_style middle

# molecule keyword, linear, vol fraction, number of blocks, block length, block species
molecule linear phi 0.5 1 20 C smear gaussian 0.4

# potential keyword, style Helfand, kappa*Nr, time step
potential helfand 50.0 0.5 updateScheme EMPC

# potential keyword, style Flory, type I, type J, chi*Nr, delt+, delt-
# Strong A-C repulsion, seeded with one period of a sine wave along x to
# place two flat interfaces in the box.
potential flory A C 14.0 0.5 0.5 updateScheme EMPC initialize sin 0 2.0 0.0 1

# Weak B-C repulsion: the B end is the site that adsorbs to the interface.
potential flory B C 2.0 0.5 0.5 updateScheme EMPC

# potential keyword, style maiersaupe, species, mu*Nr, time step
# The homogeneous isotropic-nematic threshold for this mesogen at full density is
# mu*Nr = 4 * Nr * Ntot = 120, so the bulk mesogen phase is isotropic here and
# the orientational order (SxxSpecies0.dat, orderParamSpecies0.dat) is induced by the interface.
potential maiersaupe A 100.0 2.0 updateScheme EMPC initialize xx random 0.05 0.0 initialize xy random 0.05 0.0

logFreq 250
chemFieldFreq 1000
densityFieldFreq 250

endBox

run nvt 3000
